<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', background: '#FFFFFF', fontFamily: "'Microsoft YaHei', 'PingFang SC', 'Noto Sans CJK SC', sans-serif", padding: 0 }}>
    <Box style={{ height: 72, background: '#0E3F8C', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', padding: '0 40px' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>Paper2Video 项目汇报</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#8FB6E8', letterSpacing: 2 }}>难点 3 / 4</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', padding: '24px 40px', gap: 14 }}>
        <Box style={{ height: 44, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 16 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 5, height: 34, background: '#1E4FA8', borderRadius: 2 }} />
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>单卡 16GB 的连锁反应</Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ height: 56, background: '#E8EFF8', borderLeft: '4px solid #1E4FA8', borderRadius: 4, padding: '0 20px', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 16 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', letterSpacing: 1 }}>先问一句</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#1A2230' }}>一条论文从结构化到出片，本机实测 27.2 分钟。时间到底花在哪一步？</Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ height: 290, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 6, padding: '6px 12px' }}>
            <Chart
                style={{ width: '100%', height: 278 }}
                chartType='barChart'
                barDirection='bar'
                title='各阶段真实耗时（分钟）'
                titleColor='#0E3F8C'
                showLegend={false}
                showDataLabels={true}
                axisColor='#8B97A8'
                dataLabelColor='#1A2230'
                colors={['#1E4FA8']}
                data={[
                    ['阶段', '耗时（分钟）'],
                    ['数字人生成', 10.2],
                    ['语音合成', 7.6],
                    ['光标定位', 3.8],
                    ['合成视频', 1.7],
                    ['结构化正文', 1.4],
                    ['生成幻灯片', 1.3],
                    ['生成讲稿与光标描述', 1.1],
                ]}
            />
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ height: 118, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 6, padding: '14px 20px', flexDirection: 'row', gap: 24, alignItems: 'center' }}>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 3 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 40, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', lineHeight: 1.05 }}>3.8</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.35 }}>联网的<br />分钟数</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 1, height: 66, background: '#D6DCE5' }} />
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 3 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 40, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#8B97A8', lineHeight: 1.05 }}>23.3</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.35 }}>本机 GPU 的<br />分钟数</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 1, height: 66, background: '#D6DCE5' }} />
            <Text style={{ flex: 1, fontSize: 16, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.45 }}>论文用多进程池把各页摊到 8 张卡上并行，每个进程各持一份完整权重——这在单卡上必然爆显存，只能改成串行、按阶段加载再卸载。峰值显存从 24GB 以上压到约 10GB，代价就是那个 6 倍加速我拿不到。搬到多卡服务器上，这个并行应该加回来。</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 48, padding: '0 40px', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>数据来源：一次完整跑通的任务日志（result 与 job 记录一致）</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>11 / 15</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
